{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "天枢：寒证隔姜灸优于针；热实宜针不宜灸（灸如火上加油更燥痛）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st25"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "如果是热时，你的针下针会比灸好", "seg_from": 24, "seg_to": 30, "start_s": 110.6, "end_s": 149.02, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=110s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 110.6, "end_s": 149.02}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "天书=天枢；揪=灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "天枢为大肠募，关元为小肠募，中脘为胃募（负四针配穴）；蛋白尿等可针天枢。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st25", "acupoint.cv4", "acupoint.cv12", "concept.mu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "天书是大肠的墓，关元是小肠的墓", "seg_from": 44, "seg_to": 44, "start_s": 207.92, "end_s": 225.335, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=207s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 207.92, "end_s": 225.34}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "天书=天枢；墓=募；中皖=中脘", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "中极为膀胱募；水道（关元旁开）与水分常合用，治水肿、腹水。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st28", "acupoint.cv9", "acupoint.cv3"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "能够通理水水肿、肚子腹水", "seg_from": 76, "seg_to": 78, "start_s": 398.15, "end_s": 433.055, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=398s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 398.15, "end_s": 433.06}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "水稻=水道", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "归来名义与睾丸上缩等症相关；中极、气冲、归来、关元一带近胞宫，常灸可助孕。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st29", "acupoint.st30", "acupoint.cv3", "acupoint.cv4"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "常常灸它的话，都容易住晕，帮她怀孕", "seg_from": 79, "seg_to": 92, "start_s": 434.81, "end_s": 539.685, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=434s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 434.81, "end_s": 539.68}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "住晕=受孕；官员=关元", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "腹部针宜慎，最好勿深刺。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "腹部的针最好竞争，最好不要蒸它", "seg_from": 89, "seg_to": 89, "start_s": 506.65, "end_s": 513.595, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=506s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 506.65, "end_s": 513.6}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "竞争=禁针/慎针；蒸=深", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "伏兔在膝盖直上六寸，取象跪时股肌隆起如伏兔。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st32"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "膝盖头直上六寸好，是不是伏兔穴", "seg_from": 111, "seg_to": 115, "start_s": 630.11, "end_s": 654.625, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=630s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 630.11, "end_s": 654.62}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "男人年过三十宜常灸足三里；腹上灸后若燥热，可灸足三里引火气下行。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st36"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "男人那年过三十，就要开始多灸灸足三里", "seg_from": 265, "seg_to": 295, "start_s": 1508.041, "end_s": 1649.726, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=1508s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 1508.04, "end_s": 1649.73}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-022.kp0008", "video_id": "zj-022", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "足三里为胃经合穴、土中之土，为大穴；治恶心呕吐、足软不能远行；针灸皆可，保养可灸至百壮。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st36", "meridian.st"], "chapter_id": "zj-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "足三里是胃经的和穴", "seg_from": 268, "seg_to": 285, "start_s": 1522.021, "end_s": 1599.821, "citation": {"youtube_id": "iil61YJzV6c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iil61YJzV6c&t=1522s", "series": "zj", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 22", "start_s": 1522.02, "end_s": 1599.82}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "和穴=合穴", "source": "llm_read"}
